{"title":"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prove that for every natural number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, and for every real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/f/49f75bcbf611f5df627013f23af8893c6b3f770c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\neq \\frac{k\\pi}{2^t}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"37\" /> (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad724f8a3a596305857e6d7c0c9327705ca93eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=0,1, \\dots, n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"108\" height=\"16\" />; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> any integer)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/3/4a3adede6c471d5c65e37bdfb9f4961dc8f6b823.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{\\sin{2x}}+\\frac{1}{\\sin{4x}}+\\dots+\\frac{1}{\\sin{2^nx}}=\\cot{x}-\\cot{2^nx}\\]\" width=\"380\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, we prove <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/3/fc33e6a45c0e96f78d10c6099795df33aca9fcba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cot \\theta - \\cot 2\\theta = \\frac {1}{\\sin 2\\theta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"177\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>LHS<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/0/a5084080d10bafde5f0bb9f87bddbb8c8a157c60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ =\\ \\frac{\\cos \\theta}{\\sin \\theta}-\\frac{\\cos 2\\theta}{\\sin 2\\theta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"144\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/a/69aefef6362010566606cfcc2b8f5dfc58f40019.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\frac{2\\cos^2 \\theta}{2\\cos \\theta \\sin \\theta}-\\frac{2\\cos^2 \\theta -1}{\\sin 2\\theta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"224\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/d/88d960934bd3c0df89e478b26103aa7629c8d003.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{2\\cos^2 \\theta}{\\sin 2\\theta}-\\frac{2\\cos^2 \\theta -1}{\\sin 2\\theta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"194\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/4/934d62056b56a5314a68613422672b690b47934c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac {1}{\\sin 2\\theta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"68\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Using the above formula, we can rewrite the original series as \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/9/0e977971d7b8c93a6ab916bfa8848edc1823d8cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cot x - \\cot 2x + \\cot 2x - \\cot 4x + \\cot 4x + \\dots + \\cot 2^{n-1} x - \\cot 2^n x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"532\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Which gives us the desired answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/c/5dc5722232954b96c0e6f3af356dae4c64fe31b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cot x - \\cot 2^n x$\" width=\"115\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO\" title=\"1966 IMO\">1966 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1966 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 2026101716521